msgstr "**音樂錄影帶閃爍**\\ ：在小鼓擊打、踢鼓或強節拍上閃爍白色或明亮色彩。"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:576
msgid ""
"**Bass pulses**: Use a low frequency range so the image reacts mostly to "
"bass drums or bass lines."
msgstr "**低音脈動**\\ ：使用低頻範圍，使影像主要對低音鼓或低音線反應。"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:577
msgid ""
"**Silent driver track**: Use a muted audio clip only as the control signal "
